#==============================================================================================
#
#   os_tables - The `os` module's table, js_os_init and js_init_module_os
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of quickjs-libc.c lines 3915-4060, without the Worker class. The
#       platform string, whose value depends on the target, is exported beside the table
#       rather than in it, since a table entry is a constant.
#
#==============================================================================================

